WEBVTT

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.760
<b>Yo, yo, yonaka ni bakko suru chimi mouryou</b>

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.760
<i>Yo, yo, at midnight evil spirits stalk</i>

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.840
<b>Marude ikaino ichimi routou</b>

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.840
<i>As if they're from another world</i>

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:32.050
<b>Mitai na rhymer rhyme shini toujou</b>

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:32.050
<i>Come to rhyme rhymes</i>

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:34.220
<b>Kikoetarou? Yamini hibiku oto</b>

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:34.220
<i>Can you hear them? The sounds resonating from the darkness</i>

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:36.600
<b>Bibitte kyomi nai furi shiyouto</b>

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:36.600
<i>Scared senseless, but you pretend not to be interested</i>

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.560
<b>Koukishin wa hini hini jyoushou</b>

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.560
<i>Your curiosity grows day by day</i>

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.850
<b>Nara check shini ikou, here we, here we go ya'll!</b>

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.850
<i>So let's go check them out, here we, here we go ya'll</i>

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.060
<b>Ayashi ayaushi shima no chimi mouryou</b>

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.060
<i>The mysterious and dangerous evil spirits</i>

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.730
<b>Tabun jigoku wa manpai</b>

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.730
<i>Hell is probably full with evil spirits</i>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:48.030
<b>Afure dashita renchuu ga dantai de retsu wo nashite</b>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:48.030
<i>Those that can't get in march in a line</i>

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:49.240
<b>Kono yo ni stand-by</b>

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:49.240
<i>Waiting on stand-by in this world</i>

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:51.450
<b>Yatsura no bun basho ga mazu tannai</b>

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:51.450
<i>There aren't any spaces left for them</i>

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:53.660
<b>Dooride kisetsu towazu atsui hazu</b>

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:53.660
<i>No wonder, no matter what the season is, it's always hot</i>

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.290
<b>Aete heat up sasu ikatsui verse wo</b>

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.290
<i>Purposely heating you up with hot verses</i>

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.000
<b>Kamashite ase kakasuzo</b>

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.000
<i>That make you sweat</i>

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.790
<b>Douse yakedaro kikasena gasshou wo yo!</b>

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.790
<i>You might as well let us hear you all sing!</i>

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.830
<b>HA! Koitsuwa marude kajiba</b>

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>HA! It's just like a scene of a fire</i>

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.250
<b>Sugee nekki tamacchimau shimaguni</b>

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.250
<i>The excitement in the air heats up this island country</i>

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.380
<b>DANGER! Masu masu agacchimau COME ON!</b>

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.380
<i>DANGER! The tension keeps building COME ON!</i>

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:09.590
<b>(Kono Jipangu mouchoi de panku!)</b>

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:09.590
<i>(This Japan is about to explode!)</i>

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.760
<b>HA! Koitsuwa marude kajiba</b>

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.760
<i>HA! It's just like a scene of a fire</i>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.050
<b>Sugee nekki tamacchimau shimaguni</b>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.050
<i>The excitement in the air heats up this island country</i>

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.260
<b>DANGER! Masu masu agacchimau COME ON!</b>

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.260
<i>DANGER! The tension keeps building COME ON!</i>

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.430
<b>(Kono Jipangu mouchoi de panku!)</b>

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.430
<i>(This Japan is about to explode!)</i>

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.520
Act Two

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.980
Act Two

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.980
Act Two

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:29.740
Our domain has...

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:31.780
failed to pay taxes...

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:33.950
...and is on the brink of collapse.

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:37.990
The future of this domain depends
greatly on the Shogun's disposition.

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:52.970
Now, if we break the promise
of presenting the falcon,

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:55.390
matters will get worse and
our domain will be dissolved.

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:58.430
The falcon must be brought
back at all costs.

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:03.390
M-My apologies!

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:05.100
It's okay.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.110
Do not worry.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.460
Do what you feel is most appropriate.

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:32.510
You do know what this katana represents.

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.300
Sir!

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:44.140
How did it go?

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.980
I must go to Castle Shirasagi again.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.320
For what purpose?

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:53.950
To bring Kojiro, the falcon, back.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.660
Are you speaking the truth?

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:57.700
What do you mean?

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:01.120
Zushonosuke-san, you've been acting
strange since that time.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.290
It's as though you've
left your heart somewhere.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:16.590
That girl you were just with...
she's a forgotten god.

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:19.390
She's the princess of the forgotten gods.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.390
Is there not a reason for this?

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:26.100
There is no reason.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:29.150
- But...
- The Lord has granted me this sword.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:34.190
Your skill in swordsmanship
has finally been acknowledged.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.410
It means I must commit seppuku,

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:39.910
if I don't bring back the falcon.

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.330
The matter does not concern you.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:21.780
You're back again?
Haven't learned the lesson, huh?

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:24.410
You must have a death wish.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:25.240
You're in the way.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.290
We'll come with you, if you want.

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:29.870
What are you saying?

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.340
We've been eyeing this castle
for a while now.

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:36.210
Rumor has it, there are
lots of treasures here.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.930
Didn't know there were thieves
among evil spirits.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:42.220
In any case, a weak human like you...

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:44.430
wouldn't make it to the keep tower.

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:50.060
The princess you're wanting to see
resides in the keep tower.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:52.230
Keep tower?

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.700
I-I don't particularly want to see her.

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.450
Besides, if you want to go burglarize,

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.870
we don't need to go together.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:09.410
Well, the door to the tower
is protected by a spell.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:13.000
Ones with power cannot enter...

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:16.920
...and ones without power
would never survive.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:30.180
Great, we are friends then.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.270
We are not friends.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:02.760
Seijuro!

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:07.180
It seems your friends were all eaten
by your princess.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:09.640
Shut up!

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:12.560
Whoa! Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:29.490
So where could the treasure be?

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:31.370
Where could it be? Where could it be?

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.960
Hey, how do you get to that keep tower?!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.380
Hold on, let me light it.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:40.340
Don't worry, it's about to get
bright any minute now.

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:43.050
They came rather quickly.

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:44.510
What are you talking about?

00:06:56.900 --> 00:07:00.820
Well, well. We didn't have to search
too hard after all.

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:02.740
W-What is this place?

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:07.070
Wow, their presence is stronger
than I expected.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.010
Sorry, I made a mistake.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.850
Looks like even the one with power
won't be able to go home alive.

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:34.180
If you're lucky, maybe one in ten...
No, one in a hundred may make it.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.100
- Can we win?
- Probably outrun them.

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:37.440
At least one of us.

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:40.440
Here I come!

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.610
Here I come!

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:52.410
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.580
No, that's not what I meant!

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:05.380
You fool! You won't stand a chance!

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:09.640
Hurry! Run!

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:44.800
Kojiro!

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:46.800
Kojiro!

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:50.760
Kojiro! You're unharmed!

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:52.140
Aguri?

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:13.320
So then you are...

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:15.490
I am a resident of this castle.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.700
My name is Tomihime.

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.660
I'm Himekawa Zushonosuke.

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:23.080
What is your business here?

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.460
I have come to retrieve the falcon.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.420
The name of that falcon is Kojiro.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:31.090
It belongs to the Lord of this domain,
Harima no Kami.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:32.970
Please return it.

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:35.930
I cannot return this falcon.

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:40.020
Furthermore, it does not
belong to the likes of him.

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:41.640
What are you saying?!

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:46.320
That falcon was entrusted to me by
Lord Harima when it was just a chick.

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:48.070
I've raised it with my own hands.

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:51.650
What I am referring to
happened before then.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:53.860
The falcon cannot be returned.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:55.620
I must ask you to leave.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:59.200
Please, wait... Kojiro!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.710
Kojiro! Come to me!

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:03.080
Kojiro!

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:13.760
K-Kojiro.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:34.280
Wow, you're alive?

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:36.320
Thought you were a corpse.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:45.750
I survived?

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.460
You didn't survive...

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:49.130
You were saved.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.430
Why won't you kill them?

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:58.510
Hime-sama!

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:01.640
We cannot keep them in there forever.

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:04.100
Nor can we set them free!

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:06.980
Could it be?

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:10.730
You haven't developed feelings for
that human, have you?

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:13.030
There is no reason for you to think so.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:18.160
Do you think the hime-sama...?

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:19.620
In love with the human...?

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:20.780
How frightening...

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:22.450
What are you chattering about!

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:25.790
Susuki.

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:28.380
Yes.

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:31.170
We cannot allow that human to live.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:32.800
I understand...

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:39.140
What will become of us?

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:42.100
Who knows? Maybe they'll keep
us here until we die.

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:44.430
Or maybe just finish us off.

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:47.940
It seems I was right.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:07.830
Go now.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:10.210
Follow the path and you will find
your way out.

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:12.460
What about us?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:13.800
Do as you wish.

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:23.810
Go now!

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:26.810
Please return the falcon.

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:29.270
Please, give up on the bird.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:31.060
I cannot return the falcon.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:33.070
Then, I cannot return home.

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:37.440
A day in this castle is equivalent
to a year in the human realm.

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:42.370
Your family and loved ones must
be concerned by your absence.

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.250
You know what I am, don't you?

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:47.960
A forgotten god.

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:50.540
Are you not afraid?

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:53.340
I eat humans.

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:55.590
You've helped me in the past.

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:58.590
And even now you are
willing to let me go.

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:01.390
Why are you doing this?

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.350
Because you raised Aguri.

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:07.390
It seems Aguri is quite attached to you.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:11.940
Why do you refer to Kojiro,
the falcon, as Aguri?

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:14.570
Please follow me.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:19.820
We've arrived.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:23.120
As promised, I can't accompany
you any further.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:26.790
I've heard there is an evil spirit
disguised as a woman in there.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:29.290
Is that woman beautiful?

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:34.080
She's beautiful enough
to take your breath away.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:36.130
Even if you know she's a demon,

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:38.050
you can't help, but feel like
you want to hold her.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.380
Is that so...

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:44.640
Are you really going to go?

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:46.930
You may never be able
to get out of there!

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.190
Aguri is my mother.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.190
Long ago,

00:13:56.270 --> 00:14:00.440
someone was lost and wandered into
our sacred territory in the mountains.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:02.780
A human.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.490
The man was on the brink of death.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:10.830
On the first day my mother found him
she simply observed from the distance.

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:15.920
On the second day, my mother noticed
water streaming from the man's eyes.

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:20.130
She could not conceive what it was and
was unable to take her eyes off of him.

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:22.470
On the third day,

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:25.970
my mother saw that the man was thirsty.

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.350
My mother made it rain.

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:35.310
On the fourth day she realized
the man was hungry.

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:39.230
She sent him a bird.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:45.070
On the fifth day she watched as the man
trembled from loneliness.

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:49.370
My mother made a single flower
bloom by his side.

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:51.080
On the sixth day,

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.500
my mother saw that the man
had fully recovered...

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:56.080
and was about
to return to his homeland.

00:14:57.210 --> 00:15:00.250
My mother went to meet him.

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:04.880
Disguised as a human, she descended
into the human realm.

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:10.260
Thereafter, the man utilized my mother's
powers to conquer the region's domains.

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:13.770
When all was done,
he deserted my mother.

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.770
My mother, alone,
had no home to return to.

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:20.270
She died while still in her human form.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:26.530
In the end, my mother's soul
took on this shape...

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:30.030
All because she got attached to a human.

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.620
My mother was foolish.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:38.290
After losing my mother,
we became the forgotten gods.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:41.040
Is this why you bear a grudge
against humans?

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.960
We bear no grudges.

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:45.170
Then why do you
take the lives of humans?

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:48.640
We do not take their lives.
We are consuming them.

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:50.550
My acquaintances were also killed.

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:52.560
Because they entered the castle.

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.730
That's no reason to eat humans!

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:57.440
You humans eat fish and birds!

00:15:57.730 --> 00:15:58.770
But humans and fish are dif...

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:01.690
Whether human or a fish,
we each have one life.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.110
If we do not eat, we become hungry.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:07.200
If we do not eat, we suffer.

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:08.450
We become thin and...

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:09.490
laid up with weakness.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:12.490
We become incapable of moving,
like withered grass...

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:14.240
And yet we cannot die.

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:19.120
If you still ask why we eat humans,
then please tell me.

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:21.960
Why do we exist?

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.380
That is...

00:16:24.510 --> 00:16:26.470
What is that sensation
which you call sweet?

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:30.430
Why do I need to wear a kimono
with such vivid colors?

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:33.390
I can dance as if I'm human.

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:36.060
But I don't know what it means.

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:39.440
I don't understand the concept
of how humans love one another.

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:44.070
We descended to earth.

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:45.730
We neither live nor die.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.990
We continue to just be.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:50.820
We simply continue existing
for all eternity.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.330
Please, go home.

00:16:58.830 --> 00:16:59.790
I can't.

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:01.920
I've already explained it to you.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.290
That falcon is my...

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:06.760
No, I do not want you to return the falcon.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:09.720
I cannot leave you behind.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:14.680
I cannot leave you while
you suffer here alone.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.430
Such foolish talk...

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:26.280
Please do not lie.

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:32.070
You do not genuinely believe
what your mother did was wrong.

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:35.780
Your mother was happy, was she not?

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:38.950
Let go of me!

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.420
Then why did you appear in front of me?

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:43.790
Why did you spare my life?

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:49.340
You should already know
why you are here.

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.720
And my feelings are the same.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:59.470
That wasn't a dream within a dream.

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:16.200
Tomihime...

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:27.210
If you still wish for me to leave,

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:30.260
kill me right here right now, Tomihime.

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:33.380
I will never acknowledge
my mother's ways.

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:34.970
But...

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:39.600
Like my mother, I've developed
a liking for imitating humans.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:42.600
I want to know what love is...

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:47.610
I want to make flowers bloom
for your sake.

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:28.480
What are you thinking?

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:30.820
Do you regret what you have done?

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:31.820
No...

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:37.110
From the moment we met,
something has been bothering me.

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:41.450
It's as if we've met before.

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:43.950
I've been feeling this way
for quite some time.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:46.330
I was just remembering that now...

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:48.130
We've never met.

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:52.460
When I was a child, I was fascinated
with my father's kaleidoscope.

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:54.130
Kaleidoscope?

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:57.260
The previous Lord gave it to my father.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:59.050
It was our family heirloom.

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:02.180
When you look into it like this,

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:05.600
the pieces inside would sparkle
and change their shapes.

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:07.020
It was very beautiful.

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:10.400
Your eyes remind me of that.

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:16.700
I wish I was born as this kaleidoscope.

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:18.320
What are you saying?

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:23.990
To be born in the human realm
and be watched by you, in your hands.

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:25.660
It would have been enough.

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:30.330
But that is so far away.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:32.630
We are so close together...

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:36.210
Yet my world and your world
are so far apart.

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:41.090
Let's go.

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:42.890
Let us go!

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:46.270
If we go to the neighboring town, we can
walk freely without being recognized.

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:55.280
Uba-sama!

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:56.530
What is it?

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:57.780
Tomihime-sama...

00:20:57.860 --> 00:20:59.280
She ran off with that man!

